---
// Sección 4 · Mockup: documentacion/seccion4@2x-100.jpg
// "El corazón del campo": reproductor de relatos sonoros. Card con botón de
// micrófono, datos del productor (nombre, marca, municipio), barra de progreso
// con timestamps y caja de subtítulos. Flechas para pasar de un audio a otro.
// Usar <audio> + <input type="range"> nativos, sin librería.
---

<section class="corazon-campo">
  <div class="audio-header">
    <h2>EL CORAZÓN DEL CAMPO: <span class="highlight">La voz del territorio</span></h2>
    <p>Nadie narra la transformación mejor que quienes la viven día a día. <strong>Te invitamos a cerrar los ojos y escuchar estos relatos sonoros grabados directamente en el territorio.</strong></p>
  </div>

  <div class="audio-player-wrapper">
    <!-- Controles prev/next integrados como botones a los lados en desktop, o abajo en móvil -->
    <button class="nav-btn nav-prev" aria-label="Anterior audio">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline></svg>
    </button>
    
    <div class="audio-player-card">
      <div class="player-left">
        <button class="mic-play-btn" aria-label="Reproducir audio" id="playPauseBtn">
          <!-- Mic icon as placeholder for play button -->
          <img src="https://placehold.co/64x64/003366/FFFFFF?text=Mic" alt="Reproducir" width="64" height="64" class="mic-icon" />
          <!-- Play overlay icon -->
          <div class="play-overlay">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="white" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon></svg>
          </div>
        </button>
        <div class="producer-info">
          <h4>Andrés Pineda</h4>
          <p class="brand">Café Montepineda</p>
          <p class="location">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg>
            Pradera, Valle del Cauca
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="player-right">
        <div class="timeline">
          <input type="range" min="0" max="110" value="0" class="progress-bar" id="audioProgress" />
          <div class="timestamps">
            <span id="currentTime">00:00</span>
            <span id="duration">01:50</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subtitles-box">
          <p>«En sus propias voces, las y los productores nos comparten sus memorias, los retos que enfrentan y cómo el cultivo se convirtió en su herramienta de paz.»</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <button class="nav-btn nav-next" aria-label="Siguiente audio">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
  
  <!-- Elemento de audio nativo oculto -->
  <audio id="audioElement" preload="metadata">
    <!-- <source src="/audio/ejemplo.mp3" type="audio/mpeg"> -->
  </audio>
</section>

<style>
  .corazon-campo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8, 2rem);
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-komet);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .audio-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4, 1rem);
  }

  .audio-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--color-brand, #171717);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .audio-header h2 .highlight {
    color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    display: block;
  }

  .audio-header p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .audio-header strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* WRAPPER FOR CARD AND CONTROLS */
  .audio-player-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-4, 1rem);
    width: 100%;
  }

  .nav-btn {
    background-color: var(--color-surface, #ffffff);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border, #d6d3d1);
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .nav-btn:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    border-color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    color: var(--color-surface, #ffffff);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .audio-player-wrapper {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .nav-btn {
      order: 3;
      margin-top: var(--space-2, 0.5rem);
    }
  }

  /* CARD STYLES */
  .audio-player-card {
    flex-grow: 1;
    max-width: 800px;
    background-color: var(--color-surface, #ffffff);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d6d3d1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card, 8px);
    padding: var(--space-6, 1.5rem);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6, 1.5rem);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .audio-player-card {
      grid-template-columns: 3fr 5fr;
      align-items: center;
      padding: var(--space-8, 2rem);
    }
  }

  /* LEFT SIDE: INFO & BUTTON */
  .player-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4, 1rem);
  }

  .mic-play-btn {
    position: relative;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    overflow: hidden;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .mic-play-btn:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .mic-icon {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .play-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: rgba(0, 51, 102, 0.7);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .mic-play-btn:hover .play-overlay {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* Playing state */
  .mic-play-btn.playing .play-overlay {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .mic-play-btn.playing .play-overlay svg polygon {
    display: none; /* Hide play */
  }

  /* Draw a pause icon when playing (using lines or rectangles, simpler with CSS but inline SVG override works here) */
  .mic-play-btn.playing .play-overlay::after {
    content: '';
    width: 10px;
    height: 14px;
    border-left: 3px solid white;
    border-right: 3px solid white;
    position: absolute;
  }

  .producer-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .producer-info h4 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .producer-info .brand {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .producer-info .location {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* RIGHT SIDE: TIMELINE & SUBTITLES */
  .player-right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4, 1rem);
  }

  .timeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2, 0.5rem);
  }

  /* Styling the range input */
  .progress-bar {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    width: 100%;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--color-border, #d6d3d1);
    border-radius: 3px;
    outline: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .progress-bar::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.1s;
  }

  .progress-bar::-moz-range-thumb {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
  }

  .progress-bar:active::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    transform: scale(1.2);
  }

  .timestamps {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-monique-regular);
  }

  .subtitles-box {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-muted, #f5f5f4);
    padding: var(--space-3, 0.75rem) var(--space-4, 1rem);
    border-radius: var(--radius-control, 6px);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-nav-text, #32509d);
  }

  .subtitles-box p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>

<script>
  // Script para manejar el reproductor de audio (mock)
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const playBtn = document.getElementById('playPauseBtn');
    const progressBar = document.getElementById('audioProgress') as HTMLInputElement;
    const audioElement = document.getElementById('audioElement') as HTMLAudioElement;
    
    let isPlaying = false;
    let mockInterval: any = null;

    if(playBtn && progressBar) {
      playBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        isPlaying = !isPlaying;
        
        if(isPlaying) {
          playBtn.classList.add('playing');
          // Simular reproducción si no hay source real
          if(!audioElement.src || audioElement.src === window.location.href) {
            mockInterval = setInterval(() => {
              let val = parseInt(progressBar.value);
              if(val < parseInt(progressBar.max)) {
                progressBar.value = (val + 1).toString();
                // Aquí se actualizaría el tiempo actual (currentTime)
              } else {
                // Termina
                clearInterval(mockInterval);
                playBtn.classList.remove('playing');
                isPlaying = false;
                progressBar.value = '0';
              }
            }, 1000);
          } else {
            audioElement.play();
          }
        } else {
          playBtn.classList.remove('playing');
          if(!audioElement.src || audioElement.src === window.location.href) {
            clearInterval(mockInterval);
          } else {
            audioElement.pause();
          }
        }
      });
    }
  });
</script>
